  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Nyfs_Quivers/BH_NQ_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1083\" height=\"310\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/846584887955161120/921462006991712256/unknown.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Nyfs_Quivers/BH_NQ_About.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1083\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<p>Nyfs Quivers 目前為遊戲新增了 5 種箭袋尺寸（從皮革到下界合金），可存放 9 至 45 組箭矢，它採用「作用中欄位」機制，你可以在其間切換</p>\n<p>以決定弓箭將使用哪種箭矢！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Forge 1.18 新內容：<br>融合附魔：當你隱形時，穿戴與手持的此附魔物品也會變得隱形。<br>進階工具提示：按住 Shift 鍵時顯示箭袋內的物品。</p>\n<p>快捷鍵可開啟當前裝備的箭袋<br><br>Forge 1.18.2 新內容：<br>循環附魔 - 跳過空的箭袋欄位<br>無限箭矢附魔 - 所有箭矢類型皆可使用有限次數的無限箭矢。（移除並重新附加附魔即可刷新使用次數）<br><br>設定選項：可縮放 GUI 欄位</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>按住 Shift 鍵並右鍵點擊即可為箭袋更名。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><em><strong>Nyf's Quivers Forge 版需要 Curios</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><em><strong>&nbsp;</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><em><strong>Nyf's Quivers Fabric 版需要 Trinkets</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/WbNYM68Bkt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wws25mh.png\" alt=\"加入我的 Discord\" width=\"397\" height=\"127\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tawniey\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>Tawniey</span></a>&nbsp;製作了超棒的資源包！<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rustic-alternates-nyfs-quivers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TQikBXf.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>衷心感謝&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<h2><span><span>SuperMartijn642</span></span></h2>\n<p>以及他的模組<br><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packed-up-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PACKED UP</a></strong></span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">為本模組得以完成奠定了基礎。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/thenyfaria\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teaprincesschronicles.files.wordpress.com/2020/03/support-me-on-patreon.png?w=150&h=41\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252fnyfaria\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/977009237861498990/977009315258982420/donate.png\" width=\"399\" height=\"74\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fnyfsmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Nyfs_Quivers/BH_NQ_Promo.webp\" width=\"1083\" height=\"194\"></a></p>",
